---
description: >-
  Three levels of nested `flow` containers (review_agent > pipeline >
  extract/assess), each holding its own simple two-node chain, to verify
  deeply nested flow container layout.
---
agentflow-beta LR
  flow review_agent["Code Review Agent"]
    flow pipeline["Review Pipeline"]
      flow extract["Extract Changes"]
        receive_pr("Receive PR")
        analysis["Code Analysis"]
        receive_pr --> analysis
      end
      flow assess["Assess Risk"]
        evaluate("Evaluate")
        risk["Risk Assessment"]
        evaluate --> risk
      end
      extract --> assess
    end
  end
